                <h1 class="content-title">Reconciliation & <span class="gradient-text">Publisher Packs</span></h1>
                <p class="content-subtitle">
                    The mathematical computation core of SAM Pro. Translates server hardware topology, virtualization clusters, downgrade rights trees, and complex vendor licensing rules into the definitive Effective License Position (ELP).
                </p>
